ding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/72/fj6iwvz2xpvinf5ptffdrj5z5ijeu5c.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A1%80%E6%A3%98%E8%94%93%E7%94%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/72/fj6iwvz2xpvinf5ptffdrj5z5ijeu5c.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />血棘蔓生\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[被动]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血棘之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血棘之种</font></span></span>]造成的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>；以本技能或以被击败的方式触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血棘之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血棘之种</font></span></span>]时，所有受击目标向中心反向击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格。<br />[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血棘之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血棘之种</font></span></span>]额外增加触发方式：<br />\n✦拥有者行动结束时，若受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"定身\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">定身</font></span></span>]或未曾移动，则移除所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血棘之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血棘之种</font></span></span>]。<br />\n✦拥有者受到伤害，且该次伤害的技能倍率超过<font color=\"#ed7950\">200%</font>时，该次伤害、穿透伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，随后移除所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"血棘之种\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">血棘之种</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A1%9E%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/塞娜\"><img alt=\"头像 塞娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/2c/gk5xl4lk65d1ejg085shrrggybf1da0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">塞娜</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164244\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.416 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.556 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9876/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 161063/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12159/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,m